<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>4 Color Dice — Roll 6-Sided Color Dice | Online-Dice.com</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="mqtt.min.js"></script>
<script>
if(typeof mqtt === 'undefined'){
  document.write('<script src="https://unpkg.com/mqtt@5.3.5/dist/mqtt.min.js"><\/script>');
}
</script>
<script src="sync-service.js"></script>
<style>
/* ===== RESET & BASE (Chuẩn Online-Dice.com) ===== */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:'Open Sans',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  background:#f0f2f5;
  color:#2c3e50;
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
}

/* ===== NAVBAR (Trắng sạch, bóng nhẹ, sticky) ===== */
.navbar{
  width:100%;
  background:#ffffff;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e0e4e8;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:0 20px;
  position:sticky;top:0;
  z-index:100;
  box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  height:54px;
}
.navbar-inner{
  width:100%;
  max-width:960px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
}
.logo-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.logo-dice{display:flex;gap:3px}
.logo-die{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11px;box-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.logo-die.red{background:#e74c3c}
.logo-die.green{background:#27ae60}
.logo-die.yellow{background:#f1c40f;color:#333}
.logo-text{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2c3e50;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.logo-text span{color:#1e73be}

.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.nav-link{
  padding:6px 12px;
  font-size:12.5px;
  font-weight:600;
  color:#64748b;
  text-decoration:none;
  border-radius:6px;
  transition:all .15s;
}
.nav-link:hover{color:#1e73be;background:#f1f5f9}
.nav-link.active{color:#1e73be;background:#eff6ff;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
}

/* ===== PAGE HEADER ===== */
.page-header{text-align:center;padding:18px 10px 6px;max-width:720px;width:100%}
.page-title{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin-bottom:3px}
.page-subtitle{font-size:13px;color:#7f8c8d;font-weight:400}

/* ===== QUICK DICE COUNT PILLS (Tab bar chuẩn online-dice.com) ===== */
.dice-pills{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:5px;
  padding:8px 10px 12px;
  max-width:720px;width:100%;
}
.dice-pill{
  padding:6px 14px;
  border:1px solid #d0d5da;
  border-radius:18px;
  font-size:12.5px;
  font-weight:600;
  cursor:pointer;
  background:#fff;
  color:#555;
  transition:all .18s;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-family:inherit;
  letter-spacing:.1px;
}
.dice-pill:hover{border-color:#2980b9;color:#2980b9;background:#f0f7fd}
.dice-pill.active{
  background:#2980b9;
  color:#fff;
  border-color:#2980b9;
  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(41,128,185,.3);
}

/* ===== THEME BAR ===== */
.theme-bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 10px 10px;max-width:720px;width:100%}
.theme-btn{
  padding:4px 10px;
  border:1px solid #d0d5da;
  border-radius:14px;
  font-size:11px;
  cursor:pointer;
  background:#fff;
  color:#666;
  transition:all .18s;
  font-family:inherit;
  font-weight:600;
}
.theme-btn:hover{border-color:#2980b9;color:#2980b9}
.theme-btn.active{background:#2980b9;color:#fff;border-color:#2980b9}

/* ===== DICE STAGE (CANVAS AREA) — Nền gradient bo tròn ===== */
.stage-wrap{width:100%;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 12px}
.stage{
  position:relative;
  width:100%;
  aspect-ratio:16/10;
  border-radius:16px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:
    0 6px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.22),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}
.stage canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}

/* ===== RESULT ===== */
.result-display{
  text-align:center;
  padding:10px 10px 6px;
  font-size:15px;
  color:#2c3e50;
  font-weight:600;
  min-height:38px;
  max-width:720px;width:100%;
}
.result-display .total{font-size:28px;color:#2980b9;font-weight:700}
.color-badge-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:5px}
.color-badge{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:4px;
  padding:5px 16px;
  border-radius:18px;
  color:#fff;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:700;
  box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
  text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}
.color-summary-text{font-size:13px;color:#666;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px}

/* ===== CONTROLS ===== */
.controls{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:10px;
  padding:10px 10px 14px;
  max-width:720px;width:100%;
}
.btn-roll{
  padding:13px 42px;
  border:none;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-family:inherit;
  color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#219a52);
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(39,174,96,.35);
  transition:all .18s;
  letter-spacing:.3px;
}
.btn-roll:hover{filter:brightness(1.06);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(39,174,96,.4)}
.btn-roll:active{filter:brightness(.94);transform:translateY(0)}
.btn-roll:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}
.btn-mode{
  padding:11px 20px;
  border:none;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-size:13.5px;
  font-weight:600;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-family:inherit;
  color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e67e22,#d35400);
  box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(230,126,34,.3);
  transition:all .18s;
}
.btn-mode:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
.install-link{font-size:12px;color:#2980b9;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed #2980b9;padding-bottom:1px}
.install-link:hover{color:#1a5276}

/* ===== DICE COUNT SELECTOR (hidden) ===== */
.dice-count-bar{display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 0 10px}
.dice-count-bar label{font-size:13px;color:#555;font-weight:600}
.dice-count-bar select{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px}

/* ===== ROLL HISTORY ===== */
.history-section{width:100%;max-width:720px;margin:6px auto 28px;padding:0 12px}
.history-card{
  background:#ffffff;
  border:1px solid #e0e4e8;
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.history-header{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  padding:10px 16px;
  background:#f8f9fb;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e8eaed;
}
.history-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.history-count{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:12px;background:#e8f4fd;color:#2980b9}
.btn-clear-hist{
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid #ddd;
  color:#888;
  padding:4px 10px;
  border-radius:5px;
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:600;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:all .15s;
  font-family:inherit;
}
.btn-clear-hist:hover{background:#fef0f0;color:#e74c3c;border-color:#e74c3c}
.history-stats-bar{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  align-items:center;
  gap:5px;
  padding:7px 16px;
  background:#f4f6f8;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e8eaed;
  font-size:11px;
}
.history-stat-pill{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:3px;
  padding:2px 8px;
  border-radius:12px;
  color:#fff;
  font-weight:700;
  font-size:10.5px;
  box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.14);
  text-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}
.history-list{max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.history-item{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  padding:7px 10px;
  background:#fcfdfe;
  border:1px solid #edf0f5;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-size:12.5px;
  transition:background .12s;
}
.history-item:hover{background:#f0f5fa}
.history-item-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hist-idx{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#8a99a8;min-width:30px}
.hist-time{font-size:10.5px;color:#95a5a6;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.hist-badges{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hist-chip{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  padding:2px 8px;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:#fff;
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:700;
  box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.14);
  text-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}
.history-item-right{text-align:right}
.hist-summary{font-size:11.5px;color:#666;font-weight:600}
.history-empty{text-align:center;padding:22px 10px;color:#95a5a6;font-size:13px;font-style:italic}

/* ===== OWNER PANEL ===== */
.owner-toggle{
  position:fixed;bottom:16px;right:16px;
  height:40px;padding:0 15px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:rgba(44,62,80,.85);
  color:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;
  z-index:200;
  transition:all .2s;
  font-family:inherit;opacity:1;
  backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
}
.owner-toggle:hover{background:rgba(41,128,185,.9);transform:scale(1.04)}
.owner-toggle.hidden-mode{display:none!important}

.nav-admin-btn{
  position:absolute;right:14px;
  padding:5px 12px;
  background:rgba(44,62,80,.08);
  color:#555;
  border:1px solid #d5d9dd;
  border-radius:6px;
  font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:all .15s;
  font-family:inherit;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;
}
.nav-admin-btn:hover{background:#2980b9;color:#fff;border-color:#2980b9}
.nav-admin-btn.hidden-mode{display:none!important}

/* Owner overlay: Backdrop + Sidebar */
.owner-overlay{
  display:none;
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;
  width:100vw;height:100vh;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
  z-index:99999;
  justify-content:flex-end;
  align-items:stretch;
}
.owner-overlay.show{display:flex!important}

.owner-panel{
  background:#fff;
  width:360px;max-width:92vw;height:100%;
  padding:22px 18px;
  overflow-y:auto;
  box-shadow:-6px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  position:relative;
  animation:ownerPanelSlide .22s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
}
@keyframes ownerPanelSlide{
  from{transform:translateX(100%);opacity:0.6}
  to{transform:translateX(0);opacity:1}
}
.owner-panel h2{font-size:15px;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.owner-panel h2 .lock{font-size:18px}
.owner-panel .section{margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
.owner-panel .section:last-child{border-bottom:none;margin-bottom:0}
.owner-panel .section h3{font-size:13px;color:#2980b9;margin-bottom:7px;font-weight:700}
.owner-panel label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#555;margin-bottom:3px}
.owner-panel input[type=text],
.owner-panel input[type=password],
.owner-panel input[type=color],
.owner-panel select{width:100%;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:5px}
.owner-panel input[type=color]{height:36px;padding:2px;cursor:pointer}
.owner-panel .btn-save{
  padding:9px 22px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#219a52);
  color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;
  font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(39,174,96,.25);
}
.owner-panel .btn-save:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.owner-panel .btn-close{position:absolute;top:8px;right:12px;background:none;border:none;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;color:#999}
.owner-panel .btn-close:hover{color:#333}
.pin-gate{text-align:center;padding:18px 8px}
.pin-gate input{
  text-align:center;
  letter-spacing:8px;
  font-size:24px;font-weight:700;
  max-width:180px;
  margin:0 auto 14px;
  padding:10px 14px;
  border:2px solid #2980b9;
  border-radius:8px;
}
.pin-gate .btn-pin{
  padding:10px 34px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2980b9,#2471a3);
  color:#fff;border:none;
  border-radius:6px;
  font-weight:700;font-size:14px;
  cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;
  box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(41,128,185,.3);
}
.pin-gate .btn-pin:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
.pin-error{color:#e74c3c;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:8px;display:none}

/* face color grid */
.face-color-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:7px}
.face-color-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}
.face-color-item span{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#555}
.face-color-item input[type=color]{width:48px;height:32px}

/* ===== THEME BAR WRAP ===== */
.theme-bar-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 10px 10px;max-width:740px;width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap}
.theme-bar-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#7f8c8d;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px}

/* ===== ABOUT / INFO SECTION (CHUẨN ONLINE-DICE.COM) ===== */
.info-section{width:100%;max-width:720px;margin:12px auto 28px;padding:0 12px}
.info-card{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e0e4e8;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.info-card h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:-.2px}
.info-card p{font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:14px}
.info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
.info-box{background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid #edf0f5;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px}
.info-box h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2980b9;margin-bottom:4px}
.info-box p{font-size:12px;color:#666;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0}

/* ===== FOOTER LINKS ===== */
.footer-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:12px}
.footer-links a{color:#64748b;text-decoration:none}
.footer-links a:hover{color:#2980b9;text-decoration:underline}
.footer-links span{color:#cbd5e1;font-size:11px}

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
footer{
  padding:22px 10px 20px;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:11.5px;
  color:#94a3b8;
  margin-top:auto;
  border-top:1px solid #e8eaed;
  width:100%;
  background:#fafbfc;
}
footer a{color:#2980b9;text-decoration:none}

/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
@media(max-width:500px){
  .navbar{padding:6px 12px}
  .logo-text{font-size:15px}
  .logo-die{width:20px;height:20px;font-size:10px}
  .page-title{font-size:22px}
  .btn-roll{padding:11px 28px;font-size:15px}
  .btn-mode{padding:9px 16px;font-size:12.5px}
  .dice-pill{padding:5px 10px;font-size:11.5px}
  .stage{aspect-ratio:4/3}
  .info-card{padding:16px 14px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ========== NAVBAR ========== -->
<nav class="navbar">
  <div class="navbar-inner">
    <div class="logo-wrap" id="logoWrap" title="Online-Dice">
      <div class="logo-dice">
        <div class="logo-die red">⚄</div>
        <div class="logo-die green">⚂</div>
        <div class="logo-die yellow">⚅</div>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-text">ONLINE-DICE<span>.COM</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#" class="nav-link" onclick="return false">Standard Dice</a>
      <a href="#" class="nav-link active" onclick="return false">Color Dice</a>
      <a href="#" class="nav-link" onclick="return false">Perya Color</a>
      <a href="#" class="nav-link" onclick="return false">D&D Dice</a>
    </div>
    <button class="nav-admin-btn" id="navAdminBtn" title="Mở cài đặt Admin">⚙ Admin</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ========== PAGE HEADER (ONLINE-DICE.COM) ========== -->
<div class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-title" id="pageTitle">4 Color Dice</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle" id="pageSubtitle">Roll 6-Sided Color Dice</p>
</div>

<!-- ========== QUICK DICE COUNT PILLS ========== -->
<div class="dice-pills" id="dicePills">
  <button class="dice-pill" data-count="1">1 Color Die</button>
  <button class="dice-pill" data-count="2">2 Color Dice</button>
  <button class="dice-pill" data-count="3">3 Color Dice</button>
  <button class="dice-pill active" data-count="4">4 Color Dice</button>
  <button class="dice-pill" data-count="5">5 Color Dice</button>
  <button class="dice-pill" data-count="6">6 Color Dice</button>
</div>

<!-- ========== THEME BAR ========== -->
<div class="theme-bar-wrap">
  <span class="theme-bar-label">Select Theme:</span>
  <div class="theme-bar" id="themeBar"></div>
</div>

<!-- ========== DICE COUNT (HIDDEN SELECT FALLBACK) ========== -->
<div class="dice-count-bar">
  <label for="diceCount">Number of Dice:</label>
  <select id="diceCount">
    <option value="1">1</option>
    <option value="2">2</option>
    <option value="3">3</option>
    <option value="4" selected>4</option>
    <option value="5">5</option>
    <option value="6">6</option>
  </select>
</div>

<!-- ========== CANVAS STAGE ========== -->
<div class="stage-wrap">
  <div class="stage" id="stage">
    <canvas id="diceCanvas"></canvas>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========== RESULT ========== -->
<div class="result-display" id="resultDisplay">🎲 Press <b>Go Again !</b> to roll</div>

<!-- ========== CONTROLS ========== -->
<div class="controls">
  <button class="btn-roll" id="btnRoll">🎲 Go Again !</button>
  <button class="btn-mode" id="btnMode">🎨 Color Dice</button>
  <a href="#" class="install-link" onclick="return false">📲 Install app – Fewer ads, instant access.</a>
</div>

<!-- ========== ROLL HISTORY SECTION ========== -->
<div class="history-section" id="historySection">
  <div class="history-card">
    <div class="history-header">
      <div class="history-title">
        <span>📜</span>
        <span>Roll History</span>
        <span class="history-count" id="historyCount">0 rolls</span>
      </div>
      <div class="history-actions">
        <button class="btn-clear-hist" id="btnClearHistory" title="Clear history">🗑 Clear</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="history-stats-bar" id="historyStatsBar"></div>
    <div class="history-list" id="historyList">
      <div class="history-empty">No rolls yet. Press <b>Go Again !</b> to roll the dice.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========== OWNER BUTTON ========== -->
<button class="owner-toggle" id="ownerToggle" title="Owner Panel">⚙ Admin</button>

<!-- ========== OWNER OVERLAY ========== -->
<div class="owner-overlay" id="ownerOverlay">
  <div class="owner-panel" style="position:relative">
    <button class="btn-close" id="ownerClose">&times;</button>

    <!-- PIN GATE -->
    <div id="pinGate" class="pin-gate">
      <h2><span class="lock">🔒</span> Owner Panel</h2>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#777;margin-bottom:14px">Enter PIN to access settings</p>
      <input type="password" id="pinInput" maxlength="4" placeholder="••••">
      <br>
      <button class="btn-pin" id="btnPin">Unlock</button>
      <div class="pin-error" id="pinError">❌ Wrong PIN. Try again.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PANEL CONTENT (hidden until PIN ok) -->
    <div id="panelContent" style="display:none">
      <h2><span class="lock">🔓</span> Owner Panel</h2>

      <!-- 1. Theme -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>1. Default Theme</h3>
        <select id="ownerTheme"></select>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Default dice count -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>2. Default Dice Count</h3>
        <select id="ownerDiceCount">
          <option value="1">1</option><option value="2" selected>2</option><option value="3">3</option>
          <option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Default mode -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>3. Default Mode</h3>
        <select id="ownerMode">
          <option value="classic">6-sided Dice</option>
          <option value="color">Color Dice</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Sound -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>4. Roll Sound</h3>
        <select id="ownerSound">
          <option value="on">On</option>
          <option value="off">Off</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <!-- 4b. Roll Speed -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>⚡ Tốc độ lăn xúc xắc</h3>
        <select id="ownerRollSpeed">
          <option value="0.4">⚡ Cực nhanh (0.4s)</option>
          <option value="0.7">🚀 Nhanh (0.7s)</option>
          <option value="1.0" selected>⏱️ Chuẩn (1.0s)</option>
          <option value="1.8">⏳ Chậm (1.8s)</option>
          <option value="2.8">🎭 Siêu chậm / Hồi hộp (2.8s)</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. 6 Dice Colors -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>5. 6 Dice Colors (Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Purple)</h3>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-bottom:8px">Chọn màu cho từng mặt từ 1–6.</p>
        <div class="face-color-grid" id="faceColorGrid"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Cloud Sync (Không cần máy chủ) -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>6. Mã phòng & Mật khẩu PIN 🔒</h3>
        <label>Mã phòng bí mật (Room ID):</label>
        <input type="text" id="ownerRoomId" value="dice8888" placeholder="dice8888" style="font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px">
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;color:#666;margin:4px 0 6px">Trạng thái Cloud: <b id="cloudStatusText" style="color:#28a745">● Đang kết nối...</b></p>
        
        <label style="margin-top:8px">Đổi Mật khẩu PIN mở khóa:</label>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px">
          <input type="text" id="ownerPinChange" placeholder="Nhập PIN mới (vd: 1234, 9999)" style="flex:1;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0">
          <button type="button" id="btnSaveNewPin" style="padding:6px 12px;background:#1e73be;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Lưu PIN</button>
        </div>
        <div id="pinChangeNotice" style="font-size:11.5px;color:#28a745;display:none;margin-top:2px;margin-bottom:6px">✅ Đã lưu mã PIN mới thành công!</div>

        <p style="font-size:11px;color:#777;margin-top:6px">Mở <b>remote.html</b> trên điện thoại với cùng mã phòng này để điều khiển tức thì từ xa mà không cần bật server!</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Roll History Settings -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>7. Lịch sử ra màu (Roll History) 📜</h3>
        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">
          <input type="checkbox" id="ownerShowHistory" checked style="width:16px;height:16px">
          Hiển thị bảng Lịch sử trên màn hình Live
        </label>
        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <button type="button" id="ownerBtnClearHistory" style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;background:#e74c3c;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">🗑 Xóa toàn bộ lịch sử</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Chế độ hiển thị nút Admin -->
      <div class="section">
        <h3>8. Chế độ hiển thị nút Admin ⚙</h3>
        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">
          <input type="checkbox" id="ownerHideAdminBtns" style="width:16px;height:16px">
          Ẩn toàn bộ nút Admin trên trang để Livestream (Chế độ bí mật)
        </label>
        <p style="font-size:11px;color:#777;margin-top:4px">Nếu bật, các nút Admin sẽ ẩn đi để khán giả xem live không thấy. Bạn có thể mở lại bằng phím <b>Ctrl + Shift + F12</b> hoặc thêm <b>?admin=1</b> vào link web.</p>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-save" id="btnSave">💾 Save Settings</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========== ABOUT & INFO SECTION (Online-Dice.com) ========== -->
<div class="info-section">
  <div class="info-card">
    <h2>About 4 Color Dice Roller</h2>
    <p>This virtual <b>4 Color Dice</b> simulator lets you roll 6-sided color dice online for board games, classroom activities, decision-making, and probability games. Each die features 6 distinct, vibrant colors instead of standard numbers: <b>Red</b>, <b>Orange</b>, <b>Yellow</b>, <b>Green</b>, <b>Blue</b>, and <b>Purple</b>.</p>
    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-box">
        <h4>🎲 6-Sided Color Faces</h4>
        <p>Each die has six equal faces: Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, and Purple, each with an exact 1/6 (16.67%) chance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box">
        <h4>🎨 15 Table Themes</h4>
        <p>Choose between Blue, Green, Red, Pink, B&W, Heaven, Hell, Underwater, or unlockable Gold, Silver, and Bronze themes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box">
        <h4>⚡ Keyboard Shortcut</h4>
        <p>Press the <b>Spacebar</b> on your keyboard at any time to instantly roll the dice again without using your mouse.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

